<title>UK: BFI down four at 1,285.</title>
<headline>BFI down four at 1,285.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates was down four points today at 1,285, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
